KiCad 3D model library (optional)
---------------------------------

The Library can show 3D models converted from files of the KiCad 3D model
library (https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-packages3D), licensed
CC BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad libraries exception. No library file is committed
to this repository; files are fetched into the gitignored
packages/catalog/data/.kicad-3d-cache/ and converted (tessellated and
simplified, i.e. modified) into the gitignored .model-cache/ only when a
deployment links them. A deployment that does must carry the attribution.

Libraries used unmodified
-------------------------

  occt-import-js (LGPL-2.1) reads STEP and IGES files.
  three.js (MIT) renders 3D views.

Every other dependency is listed in pnpm-lock.yaml with its own licence.
